AudioMesh 1.0.0\par
\par
This installer installs AudioMesh and, if it is not already present, the Microsoft .NET 8 Desktop Runtime (x64).\par
\par
AudioMesh routes one audio stream to every Windows playback endpoint. Settings are stored per user in %APPDATA%\\AudioMesh.\par
